%
% Backward goal: list length, empty-list edge case — gmeow:listLength backing (#1009 §5).
% The base case `ex:len(rdf:nil, 0)` answers directly: the empty list has length 0.
:- prefix(ex, 'https://example.org/profiles/goal-rdf-list-functions/').
:- prefix(rdf, 'http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#').
ex:len(rdf:nil, 0).
ex:len(L, N) :- rdf:rest(L, R), ex:len(R, M), N is M + 1.
?- ex:len(rdf:nil, N).
